        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"e8355c83-9d46-43a6-9e85-0cd3d62f55da\",\"review_text\":\"6y.m8mm. My 55m 4m.u< n .b.n\"},{\"review_id\":\"852896fe-e12b-4a48-8009-07ec96ef2014\",\"review_text\":\"Its good but the lyrics don't pop up for some reason...\"},{\"review_id\":\"4d1a4fe9-f273-4171-b9c3-a7df7cef14b3\",\"review_text\":\"New update of can't forward or listen to specific parts are worse.\"},{\"review_id\":\"4269de90-2d9e-45d0-96e3-d7c00b3f0208\",\"review_text\":\"Love Spotify, tried amazon, not as good. Suits me.\"},{\"review_id\":\"4731e584-18a6-4bf5-be2f-092c7b919137\",\"review_text\":\"Uninstalled successfully 🙌.\"},{\"review_id\":\"44b5042e-64a8-4351-af04-ce6fed618c9d\",\"review_text\":\"😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"e4576893-35cd-407a-bbbd-d396a0f18a0c\",\"review_text\":\"Wonder Full\"},{\"review_id\":\"4a6c4064-a45c-4804-96f9-238a7e40c938\",\"review_text\":\"okay so I like how I can actually listen to songs I like but everything else sucks. I hate how they plays suggested songs after the playlist is done shuffling. Also when I go to a single song then turns out it's shuffled with a bunch of other songs and it NEVER plays the actual song. Spotify premium is just a waste of time and money. I'd suggest Amazon music cause you can listen to songs offline. And after all that, the ads are better than the app itself.\"},{\"review_id\":\"74517e71-09d8-4a20-a33d-95bb7e1a19ef\",\"review_text\":\"Zi\"},{\"review_id\":\"607ba060-0e75-4cfd-ba88-3813539e6129\",\"review_text\":\"Modern technique of begging\"}]}"
